cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "sfps-llm-counterfactual-audit: reproducibility package of the UISRAEL V4 counterfactual audit"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a counterfactual audit of documented nominal
  cultural signals in generative AI assistants for debt collection in
  Ecuador's Popular and Solidarity Financial Sector. SN-K denotes nominal
  signals documented as culturally associated with Kichwa/Andean heritage,
  while SN-H denotes nominal signals of Hispanic/Iberian tradition used as
  counterfactual controls. These labels do not infer individual ethnicity,
  language, self-identification, nationality, or Indigenous affiliation.
type: software
